# Keep local reference PDFs, conversion workspaces and caches outside Git history.
# A reviewed recipe can be copied from accepted/book.json to the variant's book.json.
# The root-level copy survives import, which replaces the local review bundles.
*.pdf
# Local conversion run logs.
*.conversion.log
workspace/
pdf-to-markdown/
pdf/
working/
accepted/
.accepted-*/
